{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"0aa62885f87f65fd0d49e2736c969b77d272d3483a08639bf109e6b0b1fabe62","digest":{"component_or_area":"scripts/gen_env_registry.py environment variable scanner","key_entities":["scripts/gen_env_registry.py","KNOWN_ENV_HELPERS","docs/env-vars.md","_gate_str_pref","read_secret_env","_env_truthy","src/rebar/_config_resolvers.py","src/rebar/config.py","REBAR_GATE_REF","REBAR_GATE_SOURCE","JIRA_API_TOKEN","scripts/check_config_ownership.py","UnregisteredEnvReadHelper"],"problem_keywords":["environment variable registry","fail-open detection","missing helpers","env-read helper discovery","registry completeness","parameterized shim"],"propositions":["Environment-read helper functions absent from KNOWN_ENV_HELPERS are silently skipped during registry generation instead of failing closed, causing their referenced env vars to be undocumented","Two real operator-settable variables REBAR_GATE_REF and REBAR_GATE_SOURCE are missing from docs/env-vars.md because their helper _gate_str_pref is unregistered in KNOWN_ENV_HELPERS","A parameterized-shim predicate can reliably detect unregistered helpers by identifying functions whose os.environ key expressions reference their own parameters, enabling fail-closed detection without false positives","The fix adds three missing helper rows (_gate_str_pref, read_secret_env, _env_truthy) to KNOWN_ENV_HELPERS and raises UnregisteredEnvReadHelper when an env-read helper matches the predicate but has no registry entry"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787706755228425001,"uuid":"5d615359-fa31-4def-afde-22